extends RefCounted
## LEGENDEN: one short personal story per fighter, four chapters each, unlocked by playing that
## fighter (mastery stars, progression.gd MASTERY):
##   I   Herkunft      (always)   – where they come from, a first fight
##   II  Der Rivale    (★1)       – the one who knows their weak spot
##   III Der Abgrund   (★2)       – an angel or demon tests the wound
##   IV  Legende       (★3)       – the fighter meets their own shadow; ending cinematic
## Finishing chapter IV gives the fighter's relic (progression.legend_relics): +15 % healing in
## the adventure, a gold frame on the card, coins and the legend chest (rewards.gd open_legend_chest).
## Steps use the story format (story_data.gd); story_mode.gd plays them as campaign "legend".

const STARS := [0, 1, 2, 3]
